preṣitāṃ yanmayā māyāṃ manmayīmavanītalaṃ | 
tvamallamatayā sthitvā jitavānasi bho vibho || 43 || 
pratijñātaṃ nirūḍhaṃ te nirjitā'smi tvayāpyahaṃ | 
iti bruvāṇāṃ tāmīśo'pyabhimānitayā'bravīt || 44 || 
tvadīyaṃ tāmasaguṇaṃ striyaṃ kṛtvā mahīṃ prati | 
