mahāmunīnāmapi śāntireṣā na vidyate tāvadayaṃ hi dhanyaḥ | 

<pṛ0 191> bhūmāvavatārāya naṃdine śaṃkara vacanam | 

itīśvarastānupadiśya dharmasvarūpamāhūya vṛṣendramāha || 68 || 
naṃdinmahānaṃdakarastvameṣāṃ vṛṃdārakāṇāmapi vaṃdanīyaḥ | 
