<pṛ0 27> yogasiddhiparīkṣāyāṃ prabhugorakṣakayoḥ saṃvādaḥ | 

tarhi dvayorapi gatī parihṛtya bhaktyā śrīmadguheśvarapadāmburuhe bhajasva 
|| 85 || 
